Trigger glyphs in this directory (trigger-push, trigger-pull-request, trigger-schedule,
trigger-manual, trigger-chained, trigger-platform) are derived from GitHub Octicons
v19.15.1 (git-commit, git-pull-request, clock, play, workflow, zap respectively).

