Modifications: given an explicit neutral fill (#57606a) and a <title> so they render as
<img> sources (currentColor does not inherit into an <img>). They name CI-universal
trigger kinds — a push, a pull/merge request, a schedule, a manual dispatch, a run
chained off another run, a platform-originated run — and consumers map their own
event vocabulary onto them (the iconMap table formatter, spec-web-panels-standard-table).
